    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey there. I’m a color contacts designer! Maybe\nyou’ve even used some of my designs?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The thing is, I’ve been stuck in a bit of a creative\nrut recently. I guess you’d call it a slump?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I need something to get my creativity flowing!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI need inspiration through change...and I think I\nknow exactly what I need to see.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "MEGA EVOLUTION!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D004500470041002000450056004F004C005500540049004F004E002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mega Evolution is the definition of change! I need\nto see the power it brings to Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In particular, I want to see Mega Camerupt. I bet\nits powerful eruptions will blast me with ideas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And so I have to ask you... Do you think you could\nshow me Mega Camerupt in a battle?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want you to battle me and show me Mega\nCamerupt!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou’ll need to have a Camerupt holding its Mega\nStone on your team for that.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want you to battle me and show me Mega\nCamerupt!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou’ll need to have your Camerupt hold its Mega\nStone for that.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Show me a Mega Camerupt in our battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
