      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure thing!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530075007200650020007400680069006E006700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait a bit",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570061006900740020006100200062006900740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please! I need inspiration to make fresh, new\ncolor contacts for everyone!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Your Mega Camerupt is sure to bring me the fire I\nneed to create new color contacts!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s no point in us battling if you don’t show\nme a Mega Camerupt! We need to try again!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oooh! Camerupt looked like it was ready to\nexplode! I’m lovestruck!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006F006F00680021002000430061006D006500720075007000740020006C006F006F006B006500640020006C0069006B0065002000690074002000770061007300200072006500610064007900200074006F000A006500780070006C006F006400650021002000492019006D0020006C006F0076006500730074007200750063006B002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And that’s got my creative spirit all fired up! I’m\npractically bursting with ideas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m ready to deliver a whole new experience to\neach and every color contacts fanatic in Lumiose!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received color contacts in new designs:\n“fired up” and “lovestruck”!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200072006500630065006900760065006400200063006F006C006F007200200063006F006E0074006100630074007300200069006E0020006E00650077002000640065007300690067006E0073003A000A201C00660069007200650064002000750070201D00200061006E00640020201C006C006F0076006500730074007200750063006B201D00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My color contacts are evolving... I guess that’s\nwhat you’d call Mega EYE-volution!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I bet if I saw more Mega Evolutions, I’d get even\nmore ideas!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnd you can change your own color contacts\nfrom the main menu whenever you want!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJust press <U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus for “Outfit & Looks,” then press <U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0002>ZR\nfor all the ways you can alter your looks!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
